{"name":"气泡卡片","description":"气泡卡片是贴近触发元素展开、可承载补充信息和少量操作的浮层组件 · 点击成员头像可展开其资料、链接和少量操作。只有一句简短解释时使用 文字提示 Tooltip 更合适；触屏设备不能只依赖悬停。 先知道 按钮 Button","quote":"点一下头像，旁边浮出一张小卡片显示资料。","agentPrompt":"请让成员头像通过点击和键盘聚焦打开气泡卡片，卡片贴近触发点，包含部门、邮箱和两个可操作入口。支持触屏、Escape 关闭和点击外部关闭，并确认鼠标能移入卡片操作。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-popover\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>气泡卡片<span>Popover</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">点一下头像，旁边浮出一张小卡片显示资料。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">气泡卡片是贴近触发元素展开、可承载补充信息和少量操作的浮层组件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>点击成员头像可展开其资料、链接和少量操作。只有一句简短解释时使用<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/tooltip?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"文字提示 Tooltip\">文字提示 <b>Tooltip</b></a>更合适；触屏设备不能只依赖悬停。</span><div class=\"prerequisite-row\" aria-label=\"先知道\"><span class=\"prerequisite-label\">先知道</span><div class=\"prerequisite-links\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/button?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"button\">按钮 <b>Button</b></a></div></div></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"popover-demo\"><div class=\"popover-card\"><div class=\"popover-user\"><span class=\"popover-avatar\">林</span><div><div class=\"popover-title\">ans-studio</div><div class=\"popover-sub\">产品经理 · 深圳</div></div></div><span class=\"popover-link\">查看主页 →</span></div><div class=\"popover-arrow\"></div><span class=\"popover-avatar popover-trigger\">林</span></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请让成员头像通过点击和键盘聚焦打开气泡卡片，卡片贴近触发点，包含部门、邮箱和两个可操作入口。支持触屏、Escape 关闭和点击外部关闭，并确认鼠标能移入卡片操作。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>点头像看人</b>：用户信息卡，带主页入口</div><div class=\"mk \"><span class=\"mk-tip-wrap\"><span class=\"mk-popover\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center\"><i style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),#722ed1);flex:none\"></i><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">ans-studio</b></div><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><span class=\"mk-link\" style=\"font-size:12px\">查看主页 →</span></span><span class=\"mk-icon-btn\">林</span></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>轻量筛选面板</b>：几个勾选项就地展开</div><div class=\"mk \"><span class=\"mk-tip-wrap\"><span class=\"mk-popover\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">筛选状态</b><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>进行中</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i>已完成</span></span><span class=\"mk-icon-btn\">▼</span></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>说明 + 操作链接</b>：快捷键、帮助入口</div><div class=\"mk \"><span class=\"mk-tip-wrap\"><span class=\"mk-popover\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">快捷键</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">⌘S 保存 · ⌘P 发布</span><span class=\"mk-link\" style=\"font-size:12px\">查看全部 →</span></span><span class=\"mk-icon-btn\">⌘</span></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>通知 / 设置小面板</b>：比 Tooltip 丰富，比弹窗轻</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-tip-wrap\"><span class=\"mk-popover\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">通知设置</b><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i>\n        <span class=\"mk-link\" style=\"font-size:12px\">管理偏好 →</span></span><span class=\"mk-icon-btn\">🔔</span></span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只有一句简短说明：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/tooltip?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"文字提示 Tooltip\">文字提示 <b>Tooltip</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><span class=\"mk-tip-wrap\"><span class=\"mk-popover\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">设置</span></span><span class=\"mk-icon-btn\">⚙</span></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">内容接近半页：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/modal?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"modal\" aria-label=\"弹窗 Modal\">弹窗 <b>Modal</b></a> 或 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/drawer?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"抽屉 Drawer\">抽屉 <b>Drawer</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><span class=\"mk-tip-wrap\"><span class=\"mk-popover\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">帮助中心</b><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:95%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:86%\"></i><span class=\"mk-link\" style=\"font-size:12px\">查看全部 24 篇 →</span></span><span class=\"mk-icon-btn\">？</span></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">需要用户确认操作：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/popconfirm?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"popconfirm\" aria-label=\"气泡确认框 Popconfirm\">气泡确认框 <b>Popconfirm</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(29,33,41,.14);padding:6px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;max-width:150px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;colo