le</span></button><span class=\"pd\">可选，说清这张卡片是什么</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"body\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">内容区</span><span class=\"pe\">Content</span></button><span class=\"pd\">列表、说明、链接，比 Tooltip 自由</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"trigger\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">触发元素</span><span class=\"pe\">Trigger</span></button><span class=\"pd\">通过点击或悬停展开，例如头像</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">用户卡片<span>User Card</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"popover-card\"><div class=\"popover-user\"><span class=\"popover-avatar\">林</span><div><div class=\"popover-title\">ans-studio</div><div class=\"popover-sub\">产品经理</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">点击头像或姓名查看身份信息</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">筛选面板<span>Filter</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"popover-card\"><div class=\"popover-title\">筛选状态</div><div class=\"popover-check\">☑ 进行中</div><div class=\"popover-check\">☐ 已完成</div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">几个筛选项就地展开，不占页面位置</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">说明带链接<span>With Link</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"popover-card\"><div class=\"popover-title\">快捷键</div><div class=\"popover-sub\">⌘S 保存 · ⌘P 发布</div><span class=\"popover-link\">查看全部 →</span></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">解释一句话不够，还要给个入口</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">头像用户卡片</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"popover-scene\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 12px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text);flex:1\">项目协作台</b>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\">🔔</span>\n        <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin:6px 8px 0\">\n        <div class=\"popover-arrow-up\"></div>\n        <div class=\"popover-card\" style=\"width:200px\">\n          <div class=\"popover-user\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\"><div><div class=\"popover-title\">林小hu</div><div class=\"popover-sub\">产品经理 · 深圳</div></div></div>\n          <span class=\"popover-link\">查看主页 →</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">表头筛选</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"popover-scene\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        <span style=\"flex:1\">名称</span><span>负责人</span><span style=\"color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">状态 ▾</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-right:6px\">\n        <div class=\"popover-arrow-up\"></div>\n        <div class=\"popover-card\" style=\"width:150px;padding:10px 12px;gap:5px\">\n          <div class=\"popover-title\" style=\"font-size:12px\">筛选状态</div>\n          <span class=\"popover-check\">☑ 进行中</span>\n          <span class=\"popover-check\">☐ 已完成</span>\n          <span class=\"popover-check\">☐ 已归档</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">快捷键说明</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"popover-scene\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 8px;align-self:flex-start\">\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\">✎</span><span class=\"icon-btn\">⬇</span><span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"color:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand)\">⌘</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-start;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-left:6px\">\n        <div class=\"popover-arrow-up\"></div>\n        <div class=\"popover-card\" style=\"width:170px\">\n          <div class=\"popover-title\">快捷键</div>\n          <div class=\"popover-sub\">⌘S 保存 · ⌘P 发布</div>\n          <span class=\"popover-link\">查看全部 →</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">通知设置面板</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"popover-scene\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:5px 10px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text);flex:1\">消息中心</b>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"color:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand)\">🔔</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin:4px 6px 0\">\n        <div class=\"popover-arrow-up\"></div>\n        <div class=\"popover-card\" style=\"width:200px;padding:10px 12px;gap:8px\">\n          <div class=\"popover-title\">通知设置</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">新评论提醒</span><label class=\"demo-switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></label></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">系统公告</span><label class=\"demo-switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"track\"></span></label></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Popover_API\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">Popover API</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/popover","markdown":"# 气泡卡片Popover\n\n你可能会说\n点一下头像，旁边浮出一张小卡片显示资料。\n\n**气泡卡片是贴近触发元素展开、可承载补充信息和少量操作的浮层组件**·点击成员头像可展开其资料、链接和少量操作。只有一句简短解释时使用[文字提示 **Tooltip**](/vibe-hub/tooltip?lang=zh)更合适；触屏设备不能只依赖悬停。\n先知道\n[按钮 **Button**](/vibe-hub/button?lang=zh)\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 请让成员头像通过点击和键盘聚焦打开气泡卡片，卡片贴近触发点，包含部门、邮箱和两个可操作入口。支持触屏、Escape 关闭和点击外部关闭，并确认鼠标能移入卡片操作。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **点头像看人**：用户信息卡，带主页入口\n\n**ans-studio**\n查看主页 →林\n- **轻量筛选面板**：几个勾选项就地展开\n\n**筛选状态**进行中已完成▼\n- **说明 + 操作链接**：快捷键、帮助入口\n\n**快捷键**⌘S 保存 · ⌘P 发布查看全部 →⌘\n- **通知 / 设置小面板**：比 Tooltip 丰富，比弹窗轻\n\n**通知设置**\n        管理偏好 →🔔\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 只有一句简短说明：使用 [文字提示 **Tooltip**](/vibe-hub/tooltip?lang=zh)\n\n设置⚙\n- 内容接近半页：使用 [弹窗 **Modal**](/vibe-hub/modal?lang=zh) 或 [抽屉 **Drawer**](/vibe-hub/drawer?lang=zh)\n\n**帮助中心**查看全部 24 篇 →？\n- 需要用户确认操作：使用 [气泡确认框 **Popconfirm**](/vibe-hub/popconfirm?lang=zh)\n\n⚠ 确认删除这条记录？\n取消确定\n\n删除\n- 全局性公告：使用 [警告提示 **Alert**](/vibe-hub/alert?lang=zh) 固定在页面中\n\n📢 本周六 02:00-04:00 系统维护，期间暂不可用\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n通知设置\n\n管理偏好 →\n\n🔔\n\n1气泡卡片Popover就地展开的容器，箭头指向触发源\n\n2标题Title可选，说清这张卡片是什么\n\n3内容区Content列表、说明、链接，比 Tooltip 自由\n\n4触发元素Trigger通过点击或悬停展开，例如头像\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n用户卡片User Card\n\n林\nans-studio\n\n产品经理\n\n点击头像或姓名查看身份信息\n\n筛选面板Filter\n\n筛选状态\n\n☑ 进行中\n\n☐ 已完成\n\n几个筛选项就地展开，不占页面位置\n\n说明带链接With Link\n\n快捷键\n\n⌘S 保存 · ⌘P 发布\n查看全部 →\n\n解释一句话不够，还要给个入口\n\n典型使用场景\n\n头像用户卡片\n\n**项目协作台**\n        🔔\n\n      \n林小hu\n\n产品经理 · 深圳\n\n          查看主页 →\n\n表头筛选\n\n名称负责人状态 ▾\n\n      \n筛选状态\n\n          ☑ 进行中\n          ☐ 已完成\n          ☐ 已归档\n\n快捷键说明\n\n✎⬇⌘\n\n      \n快捷键\n\n          \n⌘S 保存 · ⌘P 发布\n\n          查看全部 →\n\n通知设置面板\n\n**消息中心**\n        🔔\n\n      \n通知设置\n\n          \n新评论提醒\n\n          \n系统公告\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[Popover APIMDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Popover_API)"}